Winter loves to challenge us. It’s a season teeming with unexpected dress-codes, temperature drops, and parties, parties, parties. We tapped three of the industry’s most inspiring artists to create five looks to inspire your season, whether you're hosting or guesting. A post shared by Refinery29 (@refinery29) A post shared by Refinery29 (@refinery29) CREDITS: Chief Content Officer: Brooke DeVard ;
